position:absolute;left:13.5cqw;right:3.5cqw;bottom:3cqw;font:400 1.15cqw/1.4 ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,Consolas,monospace;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#6d28d9'>A fairy tale, drawn the way a story is drawn here</div></div></div>"
